{"id": "huckleberry-federal-match-city-grant", "title": "Federal auditors question a youth charity’s grant books; a City grant was used as match", "seconds": 152.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "847012d9546b82e1", "words": 398, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["timeline[2]", "story[0]", "actors[3]"], "text": "June 2026. A federal audit of a San Francisco youth charity, Huckleberry Youth Programs.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.66, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "Audit 26-058, June 2026", "text": "significant issues with Huckleberry’s financial management, including a lack of reliable accounting records and a lack of an adequate timekeeping system", "mark": "lack of reliable accounting records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.69, 2.14, 2.43, 2.78, 3.14, 3.35, 3.44, 3.63, 4.1, 4.37, 4.95, 5.42, 5.66]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[2]"], "text": "It found no reliable accounting records, and no adequate timekeeping system.", "t0": 6.78, "t1": 10.82, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "Audit 26-058, June 2026", "text": "significant issues with Huckleberry’s financial management, including a lack of reliable accounting records and a lack of an adequate timekeeping system", "mark": "lack of reliable accounting records"}, "emph": ["no reliable accounting records"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.38, 0.56, 1.01, 1.43, 2.21, 2.38, 2.55, 2.98, 3.58]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[0]", "links[2]", "established[6]"], "text": "Questioned in all: 724,578 dollars.", "t0": 10.94, "t1": 16.88, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$724,578", "label": "questioned by the Justice Department inspector general", "sub": "$579,145 of spending and $145,433 of match"}, "emph": ["724,578"], "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 0.77, 1.29, 2.11, 2.45, 3.01, 3.72, 4.24, 4.59, 5.28]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "status", "actors[0]"], "text": "That’s an official finding, from the Justice Department’s inspector general.", "t0": 17.4, "t1": 20.68, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Justice Department inspector general", "kicker": "An official finding", "sub": "audit 26-058"}, "emph": ["official finding"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.23, 0.58, 1.1, 1.54, 1.64, 2.02, 2.43, 2.84]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["status", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Questioned costs are not proven losses. They can still be documented.", "t0": 20.8, "t1": 25.53, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Justice Department inspector general", "kicker": "An official finding", "sub": "audit 26-058"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 1.06, 1.33, 1.59, 2.07, 2.61, 2.96, 3.11, 3.46, 3.65]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "links[0]", "links[1]"], "text": "Federal victim-assistance money went to the State, which passed it on to Huckleberry.", "t0": 25.75, "t1": 29.76, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "The money", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Office of Justice Programs", "sub": "federal victim-assistance grants"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Governor’s Office of Emergency Services", "sub": "subawarded $705,448"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Huckleberry Youth Programs", "sub": "the grantee"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 1.04, 1.3, 1.48, 1.55, 1.66, 2.43, 2.63, 2.88, 3.0, 3.17, 3.3]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["timeline[0]", "links[1]"], "text": "Four subawards, 705,448 dollars,", "t0": 29.88, "t1": 34.45, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "The money", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Office of Justice Programs", "sub": "federal victim-assistance grants"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Governor’s Office of Emergency Services", "sub": "subawarded $705,448"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Huckleberry Youth Programs", "sub": "the grantee"}]}, "emph": ["705,448"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 1.31, 1.57, 1.87, 2.18, 2.65, 2.9, 3.2, 3.68]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["timeline[0]", "links[1]"], "text": "for 2024 and 2025.", "t0": 34.45, "t1": 37.1, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "The money", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Office of Justice Programs", "sub": "federal victim-assistance grants"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Governor’s Office of Emergency Services", "sub": "subawarded $705,448"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Huckleberry Youth Programs", "sub": "the grantee"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.13, 0.4, 1.21, 1.59, 1.85]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[1]"], "text": "The first finding. By December 2025", "t0": 37.32, "t1": 41.04, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Reimbursed by the State", "kicker": "The first finding", "sub": "by December 2025", "chip": "$579,145"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.57, 1.64, 2.52, 2.86, 3.13]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[1]"], "text": "the State had reimbursed 579,145 dollars.", "t0": 41.04, "t1": 45.84, "shot": "b4x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Reimbursed by the State", "kicker": "The first finding", "sub": "by December 2025", "chip": "$579,145"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.28, 0.52, 0.63, 1.16, 1.4, 1.62, 2.23, 2.79, 3.27, 3.57, 4.17]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "How much of it did the auditors question?", "t0": 45.96, "t1": 47.8, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Reimbursed by the State", "kicker": "The first finding", "sub": "by December 2025", "chip": "$579,145"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.26, 0.37, 0.45, 0.57, 0.68, 1.19]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "established[0]"], "text": "All of it.", "t0": 47.8, "t1": 49.03, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["All", "of it"], "sub": "$579,145 questioned"}, "emph": ["All"], "wt": [0.04, 0.88, 1.02]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Why it matters here: the same way of splitting staff time is used on everything it bills.", "t0": 49.65, "t1": 54.53, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An organization that cannot split staff time by funder on its federal grant uses the same allocation method on everything else it bills, the City included."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.26, 0.62, 1.65, 1.79, 2.0, 2.18, 2.26, 2.68, 3.02, 3.33, 3.46, 3.66, 3.79, 4.2, 4.35]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "The City included.", "t0": 54.65, "t1": 55.75, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An organization that cannot split staff time by funder on its federal grant uses the same allocation method on everything else it bills, the City included."}, "emph": ["City"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.43]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "The second finding. A federal grant needs a match: the organization’s own share.", "t0": 55.97, "t1": 61.36, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "The match", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "the organization’s own share"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.45, 1.23, 1.64, 2.01, 2.46, 2.77, 2.87, 3.75, 3.85, 4.6, 4.87]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[1]"], "text": "Part of Huckleberry’s match was staff pay covered by a City grant.", "t0": 61.48, "t1": 64.69, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "The match", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "the organization’s own share"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.23, 0.79, 1.12, 1.31, 1.63, 1.97, 2.24, 2.37, 2.45, 2.74]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[1]", "links[4]", "actors[5]"], "text": "And that City grant was itself federal money, from Health and Human Services.", "t0": 64.81, "t1": 68.88, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "A City grant as match", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Administration for Children and Families", "sub": "federal money"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "City and County of San Francisco", "sub": "a grant to Huckleberry"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Counted as match", "sub": "for a second federal award"}]}, "emph": ["federal money"], "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.24, 0.52, 0.89, 1.06, 1.5, 1.85, 2.55, 2.69, 2.96, 3.1, 3.39]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[2]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Federal rules don’t let one federal award pay another’s match.", "t0": 69.0, "t1": 72.5, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "A City grant as match", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Administration for Children and Families", "sub": "federal money"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "City and County of San Francisco", "sub": "a grant to Huckleberry"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Counted as match", "sub": "for a second federal award"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.73, 0.93, 1.09, 1.34, 1.77, 2.24, 2.53, 2.89]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[0]"], "text": "Match questioned: 145,433 dollars.", "t0": 72.62, "t1": 77.5, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$145,433", "label": "reported match, questioned", "sub": "the auditors could not determine the specific amount from the City grant"}, "emph": ["145,433"], "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 1.12, 1.71, 2.06, 2.6, 3.17, 3.37, 3.66, 4.28]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[0]"], "text": "The auditors couldn’t say how much was the City grant.", "t0": 77.62, "t1": 80.53, "shot": "b9x", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$145,433", "label": "reported match, questioned", "sub": "the auditors could not determine the specific amount from the City grant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.51, 0.83, 1.09, 1.37, 1.78, 2.04, 2.15, 2.44]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Which City department’s grant it was, and how much, is the City’s question to answer.", "t0": 80.65, "t1": 85.11, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$145,433", "label": "reported match, questioned", "sub": "the auditors could not determine the specific amount from the City grant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.41, 0.95, 1.22, 1.39, 1.74, 1.88, 2.06, 2.89, 2.99, 3.11, 3.48, 3.82, 3.97]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "story[3]", "defense[0]"], "text": "Huckleberry’s response agrees a portion came from federal funds, and commits to rebuild its records.", "t0": 85.23, "t1": 90.64, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "kicker": "Huckleberry’s response", "line": "HYP concurs that a portion of the $145,433 in reported match was sourced from federal funds."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.58, 1.06, 1.43, 1.52, 1.92, 2.16, 2.31, 2.69, 3.32, 3.72, 4.18, 4.32, 4.7, 4.86]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The third finding: its counts included youth served by programs these grants didn’t fund.", "t0": 90.86, "t1": 96.54, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Youth victims served", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "counts included other programs’ work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.39, 0.97, 1.52, 1.85, 2.25, 2.52, 2.85, 3.01, 3.68, 4.14, 4.63, 5.15]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "If federal reports counted others’ work, the City’s service reports may do the same.", "t0": 96.66, "t1": 101.18, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Youth victims served", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "counts included other programs’ work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.51, 0.96, 1.29, 1.64, 2.33, 2.45, 2.83, 3.17, 3.57, 3.76, 3.87, 4.0]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "Then the City’s own money. Since fiscal 2019, five City departments have paid Huckleberry.", "t0": 101.4, "t1": 106.74, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "City payments to Huckleberry, fiscal 2019 to 2026", "rows": [["Youth department", "$10.6 million"], ["Homelessness department", "$8.0 million"], ["Health department", "$6.7 million"], ["Human Services Agency", "$3.7 million"], ["Department on the Status of Women", "$834,456"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.2, 0.53, 0.73, 1.48, 1.86, 2.18, 2.45, 3.34, 3.66, 3.92, 4.37, 4.52, 4.74]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[3]", "links[3]"], "text": "30.3 million dollars.", "t0": 106.86, "t1": 109.64, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30.3 million", "label": "paid by the City, fiscal 2019-2026", "sub": "youth department: $10.6 million"}, "emph": ["30.3 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.84, 1.17, 1.95]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[3]", "links[3]"], "text": "The youth department alone, 10.6 million.", "t0": 109.64, "t1": 114.0, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30.3 million", "label": "paid by the City, fiscal 2019-2026", "sub": "youth department: $10.6 million"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.73, 1.0, 1.49, 2.41, 2.82, 3.29, 3.76]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "The homelessness department, 8 million. The health department, 6.7 million.", "t0": 114.12, "t1": 119.46, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30.3 million", "label": "paid by the City, fiscal 2019-2026", "sub": "youth department: $10.6 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.72, 1.69, 1.85, 2.47, 2.91, 3.18, 4.18, 4.38, 4.64, 4.92]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "The City’s monitors rely on the same books the auditors couldn’t rely on.", "t0": 119.58, "t1": 123.05, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "its monitors rely on the same books the auditors could not rely on"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 